    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not a quiet period. it's just stillness. there's no \"growing\" happening here. it feels more like everything is just... done. i look at my old work and i don't even recognize that person. it's like i used to have this light inside me, and now it's just gone. i feel like a fraud pretending to be alive when there's nothing actually happening behind my eyes. it's exhausting trying to find something that isn't there.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
